00:03:37.725 --> 00:03:40.455
I think that's an interesting
concept because of course we

00:03:40.455 --> 00:03:44.954
want to build up habits, not only
language habits, but study habits.

00:03:46.035 --> 00:03:50.145
Now, another thing is one of the things
